a continuación.","meta_twitter_title":"Resumen de la Ronda SCF #42","meta_twitter_description":"¡Hola a todos!\n\nEstamos de vuelta con el resumen de la Ronda #42 del Stellar Community Fund (SCF). En esta edición, la comunidad ha vuelto a demostrar su compromiso seleccionando proyectos innovadores que expanden los límites de lo que es posible en Stellar y Soroban.\n\nAquí tienes todo lo que necesitas saber sobre los ganadores, las estadísticas y lo que viene a continuación.","audience":"free","comments_enabled":true,"comments_state":null,"enforce_gated_content":false,"enable_popup_on_scroll":true,"email_capture_title":"Enjoying this post?","email_capture_message":"Subscribe to get more content like this delivered to your inbox for free!","email_capture_cta":"Subscribe","estimated_reading_time":1,"estimated_reading_time_display":"1 minuto","paywall_id":null,"authors":[{"id":"f296a348-b27c-4e82-ae84-fce2e49bff12","name":"Pau Koh","profile_picture":{"url":"https://beehiiv-images-production.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/user/profile_picture/f296a348-b27c-4e82-ae84-fce2e49bff12/pau_headshot_1.png","thumb":{"url":"https://beehiiv-images-production.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/user/profile_picture/f296a348-b27c-4e82-ae84-fce2e49bff12/thumb_pau_headshot_1.png"},"landscape":{"url":"https://beehiiv-images-production.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/user/profile_picture/f296a348-b27c-4e82-ae84-fce2e49bff12/landscape_pau_headshot_1.png"}},"bio":"𝘊𝘔𝘎𝘙/𝘛𝘦𝘭𝘭𝘶𝘴 𝘊𝘰𝘰𝘱𝘦𝘳𝘢𝘵𝘪𝘷𝘦","twitter_handle":"kl0ren","facebook_url":null,"instagram_url":null,"linkedin_url":null,"tiktok_url":null,"youtube_url":null,"discord_url":null,"bluesky_url":null}],"content_tags":[{"id":"58f0d587-3f53-4436-bedc-0f2e915190a0","display":"Blockchain","slug":"blockchain"}],"created_at":"2026-05-04T15:28:57Z","updated_at":"2026-05-04T17:38:57Z","html":null,"hide_premium_post":false,"contains_subscriber_break":false,"is_accessible_for_free":true,"paywall_shown":false,"metered_usage_shown":false,"metered_viewed_count":null,"force_premium":false,"enforce_paywall_breaks":true,"display_thumbnail_on_web":true,"display_title_on_web":true,"display_subtitle_on_web":true,"author_urls":{"f296a348-b27c-4e82-ae84-fce2e49bff12":"https://blog.telluscoop.com/authors/pau-koh"},"custom_structured_data":null},"body":"<div class=\"_10pdwo80 dream-post-content-doc\"><div id=\"resumen-de-la-ronda-scf-42\" class=\"hynlcx0\"><h3 class=\"hynlcx1 hynlcx4\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Resumen de la Ronda SCF #42</span></h3></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">El </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><a href=\"https://communityfund.stellar.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"\" class=\"_3k8pkd0\">Stellar Community Fund (SCF)</a></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"> es un programa de premios de aplicación abierta que utiliza la opinión de la comunidad para apoyar a desarrolladores y startups que construyen sobre Stellar.</span></p></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">En esta ronda, hemos visto una diversidad increíble de soluciones, desde billeteras resistentes a la computación cuántica hasta plataformas de créditos verificables.</span></p></div><div id=\"cifras-clave\" class=\"hynlcx0\"><h4 class=\"hynlcx1 hynlcx5\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><span class=\"dl6s8g0 hxnnnr0\">📊</span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"> Cifras Clave:</span></h4></div><div class=\"dream-post-content-bulletList _1ao94nj0\"><ul translations=\"[object Object]\" class=\"_1ao94nj1\"><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>Total de proyectos premiados:</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"> 16 proyectos.</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>Monto total distribuido:</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"> Más de $1.5M en XLM.</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>Enfoque:</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"> DeFi, Infraestructura, Pagos y Herramientas para desarrolladores.</span></p></div></li></ul></div><div class=\"_7pt7ks0\"><div class=\"_7pt7ks1\"></div></div><div id=\"proyectos-ganadores-de-la-ronda-42\" class=\"hynlcx0\"><h3 class=\"hynlcx1 hynlcx4\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Proyectos Ganadores de la Ronda #42</span></h3></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">A continuación, destacamos algunos de los proyectos que han superado el proceso de revisión de panel y votación comunitaria:</span></p></div><div class=\"dream-post-content-bulletList _1ao94nj0\"><ul translations=\"[object Object]\" class=\"_1ao94nj1\"><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><a href=\"https://communityfund.stellar.org/awards/recweELi12M0ftBYZ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"\" class=\"_3k8pkd0\"><strong>Nebula Wallet</strong></a></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>:</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"> Una billetera para Stellar diseñada para ser resistente a ataques de computación cuántica ($111K).</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><a href=\"https://Genki.fi\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"\" class=\"_3k8pkd0\"><strong>Genki.fi</strong></a></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>:</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"> Fideicomisos inteligentes (Smart Trusts) nativos en Stellar ($100K).</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><a href=\"https://communityfund.stellar.org/awards/recweELi12M0ftBYZ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"\" class=\"_3k8pkd0\"><strong>ACTA</strong></a></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>:</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"> Implementación de Identidad Digital (DID) y Credenciales Verificables ($75K).</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><a href=\"https://communityfund.stellar.org/awards/recweELi12M0ftBYZ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"\" class=\"_3k8pkd0\"><strong>AXIS DEX</strong></a></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>:</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"> Lanzamiento de un nuevo intercambio descentralizado (DEX) ($136K).</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><a href=\"https://lend.xyz/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"\" class=\"_3k8pkd0\"><strong>Lend</strong></a></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>:</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"> Tokenización de bienes raíces en la red Stellar ($120K).</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><a href=\"https://communityfund.stellar.org/awards/recweELi12M0ftBYZ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"\" class=\"_3k8pkd0\"><strong>Bingtellar (Blink)</strong></a></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>:</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"> Pagos con rendimiento (yield-bearing) integrados ($112.8K).</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><a href=\"https://communityfund.stellar.org/awards/recweELi12M0ftBYZ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"\" class=\"_3k8pkd0\"><strong>Tezoro</strong></a></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>:</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"> Agregador de rendimiento DeFi nativo de Soroban ($143.8K).</span></p></div></li></ul></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><em>Puedes ver la lista completa de ganadores y sus detalles técnicos en el </em></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><a href=\"https://communityfund.stellar.org/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"\" class=\"_3k8pkd0\"><em>Panel de Proyectos del SCF</em></a></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><em>.</em></span></p></div><div class=\"_7pt7ks0\"><div class=\"_7pt7ks1\"></div></div><div id=\"cmo-funciona-el-scf-actualmente\" class=\"hynlcx0\"><h3 class=\"hynlcx1 hynlcx4\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">¿Cómo funciona el SCF actualmente?</span></h3></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">El SCF ha evolucionado hacia un modelo de </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>Gobernanza de Quórum Neural (NQG)</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"> en colaboración con BlockScience, permitiendo que las decisiones de financiación sean más democráticas y eficientes.</span></p></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Si tienes una idea, recuerda que el SCF ofrece tres vías principales de participación:</span></p></div><div class=\"vl18bi0\"><ol class=\"vl18bi1\" translations=\"[object Object]\" start=\"1\"><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>Open Track:</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"> Para equipos experimentados con casos de uso novedosos.</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>Integration Track:</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"> Para proyectos que integran soluciones existentes del ecosistema.</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>RFP Track:</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"> Para herramientas que responden a solicitudes de propuestas específicas.</span></p></div></li></ol></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>Recurso recomendado:</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"> </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><a href=\"https://stellar.gitbook.io/scf-handbook/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"\" class=\"_3k8pkd0\">Consulta el Manual del SCF (Handbook)</a></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"> para entender todos los requisitos de elegibilidad y pasos para enviar tu propuesta.</span></p></div><div class=\"_7pt7ks0\"><div class=\"_7pt7ks1\"></div></div><div id=\"preprate-para-la-ronda-43\" class=\"hynlcx0\"><h3 class=\"hynlcx1 hynlcx4\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">🗓️ ¡Prepárate para la Ronda #43!</span></h3></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">¿Estás construyendo algo en Stellar o Soroban? El proceso de selección es mensual. El primer paso es completar el </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><a href=\"https://www.google.com/search?q=https://stellar.gitbook.io/scf-handbook/getting-started\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"\" class=\"_3k8pkd0\">Formulario de Interés</a></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"> en el sitio web oficial.</span></p></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>Enlaces rápidos:</strong></span></p></div><div data-generic-embed-container=\"true\" class=\"_8dv9ja0\"><a href=\"https://discord.com/invite/stellardev\" target=\"_blank\"><div class=\"_8dv9ja2\" style=\"--generic-embed-image-width:40%\"><div data-generic-embed-layout=\"true\" class=\"border-collapse w-full flex sm:flex-row flex-col-reverse\"><div class=\"_8dv9ja1\"><div data-generic-embed-title=\"true\" class=\"rq7pc90\"><p class=\"rq7pc91\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Join the Stellar Developers Discord Server!</span></p></div><div data-generic-embed-description=\"true\" class=\"_1uh4x2v0\"><p class=\"_1uh4x2v2\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Stellar is where blockchain meets the real world. | 29621 members</span></p></div><div data-generic-embed-host=\"true\" class=\"efatai0\"><p class=\"efatai1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Discord</span></p></div></div><div data-generic-embed-image-wrapper=\"true\" data-generic-embed-image-right=\"true\" class=\"w-full mb-[20px] sm:mb-0 sm:ml-[20px] sm:w-[var(--generic-embed-image-width)] sm:basis-[var(--generic-embed-image-width)] flex\" style=\"align-self:flex-start\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/splashes/897514728459468821/06cb6f9cb643b3ec61a7a860629f1dac.jpg?size=512\" class=\"w-full h-auto object-cover\" alt=\"\"></div></div></div></a></div><div data-generic-embed-container=\"true\" class=\"_8dv9ja0\"><a href=\"https://communityfund.stellar.org/stats\" target=\"_blank\"><div class=\"_8dv9ja2\" style=\"--generic-embed-image-width:40%\"><div data-generic-embed-layout=\"true\" class=\"border-collapse w-full flex sm:flex-row flex-col-reverse\"><div class=\"_8dv9ja1\"><div data-generic-embed-title=\"true\" class=\"rq7pc90\"><p class=\"rq7pc91\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Stellar Community Fund</span></p></div><div data-generic-embed-description=\"true\" class=\"_1uh4x2v0\"><p class=\"_1uh4x2v2\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">The Stellar Community Fund is an open-application program that draws on community input to distribute awards to support projects built on Stellar and Soroban.</span></p></div><div data-generic-embed-host=\"true\" class=\"efatai0\"><p class=\"efatai1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Stellar Community Fund</span></p></div></div><div data-generic-embed-image-wrapper=\"true\" data-generic-embed-image-right=\"true\" class=\"w-full mb-[20px] sm:mb-0 sm:ml-[20px] sm:w-[var(--generic-embed-image-width)] sm:basis-[var(--generic-embed-image-width)] flex\" style=\"align-self:flex-start\"><img src=\"https://communityfund.stellar.org/img/new-scf-card.png\" class=\"w-full h-auto object-cover\" alt=\"\"></div></div></div></a></div><div data-generic-embed-container=\"true\" class=\"_8dv9ja0\"><a href=\"https://medium.com/stellar-community\" target=\"_blank\"><div class=\"_8dv9ja2\" style=\"--generic-embed-image-width:40%\"><div data-generic-embed-layout=\"true\" class=\"border-collapse w-full flex sm:flex-row flex-col-reverse\"><div class=\"_8dv9ja1\"><div data-generic-embed-title=\"true\" class=\"rq7pc90\"><p class=\"rq7pc91\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Stellar Community</span></p></div><div data-generic-embed-description=\"true\" class=\"_1uh4x2v0\"><p class=\"_1uh4x2v2\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Unlocking the world’s economic potential, together</span></p></div><div data-generic-embed-host=\"true\" class=\"efatai0\"><p class=\"efatai1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Stellar Community</span></p></div></div><div data-generic-embed-image-wrapper=\"true\" data-generic-embed-image-right=\"true\" class=\"w-full mb-[20px] sm:mb-0 sm:ml-[20px] sm:w-[var(--generic-embed-image-width)] sm:basis-[var(--generic-embed-image-width)] flex\" style=\"align-self:flex-start\"><img src=\"https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:400/1*EVUBoTPNlON05u7Bq0XQtQ.png\" class=\"w-full h-auto object-cover\" alt=\"\"></div></div></div></a></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"></p></div></div>","publication":{"name":"Tellus Cooperative","description":"La Cooperativa Blockchain de LatAm","url":"https://blog.telluscoop.com/","twitter_url":"https://x.com/telluscoop","instagram_url":"https://instagram.com/telluscoop","linkedin_url":"https://linkedin.com/company/Tellus-Coop